# wave-orchestrator operator env (optional).
#
#   cp wave-orchestrator/.env.example wave-orchestrator/.env
#   cd wave-orchestrator && make tripll ARGS='…'
#
# tripll has no API keys of its own — it dispatches to a backend CLI/API.
# Model choice and provider credentials live with that backend (see below).

# --- tripll runtime (optional) ---

# Override runs/ root (default: <repo_root>/wave-orchestrator/runs/).
# TRIPLL_RUNS=/abs/path/to/runs

# Verbose loguru + filtered agent milestones on stderr (session start, subagents, errors, done).
# TRIPLL_VERBOSE=1

# Raw stream-json tee to stderr (debug only — very noisy).
# TRIPLL_DEBUG=1

# Pause Claude five-hour window at this utilization (0.99 = stop at 99%, before hard cap).
# TRIPLL_QUOTA_UTIL_THRESHOLD=0.99

# Pause the run when cumulative provider cost (USD) reaches this total (0 = unlimited).
# TRIPLL_COST_BUDGET_USD=25

# Pass --verbose to Claude Code stream-json (off by default; use for tool-level debugging).
# TRIPLL_CLAUDE_VERBOSE=1

# --- W2 cost/retry controls ---

# Maximum concurrent nodes per batch (default 3).
# TRIPLL_MAX_PARALLEL=3

# Runaway guard: kill the agent when cumulative output tokens in assistant events
# exceeds this value (0 = disabled).  Prevents looping agents from burning tokens.
# TRIPLL_MAX_OUTPUT_TOKENS=50000

# Runaway guard: kill the agent when total tool-use block count in assistant events
# exceeds this value (0 = disabled).  Prevents tool-loop runaway.
# TRIPLL_MAX_TOOL_USES=200

# --- Control-plane API (make serve / tripll serve) ---

# Default model for newly launched runs (API-only; read by GET/PUT /api/config).
# TRIPLL_DEFAULT_MODEL=claude-3-5-sonnet

# Bearer token required on all API requests.
# Unset (or empty) = dev/localhost allow-all.  Set for any non-localhost deployment.
# TRIPLL_API_TOKEN=change-me

# SSE poll interval in seconds (default 1.0).  Lower values reduce dashboard latency.
# Set to 0.05 in test suites.  Values below 0.1 are not recommended in production.
# TRIPLL_SSE_POLL=1.0

# --- Backend auth & models (pass on the make/CLI command, not .env) ---
#
# claude_code (default):
#   make run-set SET=my-plan PROVIDER=claude_code AGENT=wave-plan-executor
#
# cursor_local:
#   make continue-run RUN=<id> PROVIDER=cursor_local MODEL=auto
#
# cursor_cloud: see specs/29-cursor-cloud-agent.md (requires sevn cloud extra)

# Repo root hint when running tripll from outside the checkout (optional).
# TRIPLL_REPO_ROOT=/abs/path/to/sevn.bot/sevn.bot
